<title>UK: LIFFE coffee down but off low, cocoa lower, quiet.</title>
<headline>LIFFE coffee down but off low, cocoa lower, quiet.</headline>
<text>
<p>COFFEE - Down but just off day's low. Watching ACPC. July $27 by 0950 GMT at $2,048 vs $50 down due.</p>
<p>COCOA - Lower in slow trade, consolidating. July 15 stg lower at 1,009 stg vs 10 stg down due</p>
<p>SUGAR - Firms in slow trade. October takes centre stage. August 50 cents higher at $319.40.</p>
</text>
